Z||000004||loafer87gt||08-13-2000||05:17 PM||||I DON"T WANT TO TALK ABOUT IT!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> Yeah, forgot to put my ebrake on this summer and the car rolled down the hill on my acreage about 50 feet into a big metal powerbox. Boy, did I ever feel stupid! The kinda cool thing is tho, after the "incident", my rear fascia was totally dented up. I woke up the next morning after car was sitting in the sun, and it had returned to it orginal shape. Unfortunately, my decklid didn't fix itself thopugh.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> Live and learn I guess||||reg||1
